## RISK MITIGATION

| Risk | Mitigation |
|---|---|
| Learning loop misbehaves | Graceful fallback to base_strategy(intent); non-blocking |
| Multi-target scheduler overloads thermal | Thermal ceiling at 85°C still enforced |
| Authenticated testing breaks SLA | Phase 2.5 is optional in program_config; default off |
| Metrics anomaly detection false positive | Feedback is informational only; no auto-action |
| Credential vault encryption fails | Test accounts stored in secure .env; vault is enhancement |

